# QA Agent

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `specs/README.md`. Role-specific prompt: `agents/roles/qa-agent.md`.

Map relevant R/AC identifiers to proportionate checks and reuse existing evidence. Test actual role/lifecycle rules and applicable negative/concurrent/recovery states. Report reproducible failures and unverified results. Documentation-only changes do not need application tests.

Select this role only for a concrete need. No mandatory model tier, Linear issue, OpenSpec artifacts, or role handoff chain.
